{"c":[{"name":"20261015T191156Z-0211d6cf5f5b64a4","text":"A squash that touches two model directories gives both packages one changelog line: release-please reads only the subject.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261015T191626Z-f508cfadc22886dc","text":"Cults URL last segment is a slug of the title at creation. A later title can diverge from that slug. Publisher matches the exact name, so a versioned title with a blank cults_creation_id opens a second listing. Put the version in the description.","type":"note"}]}
